stateDiagram-v2
Active --> Suspect: timeout/link/host/GPU fault
Suspect --> EvidenceCapture
EvidenceCapture --> DeviceLost: state continuity unprovable
EvidenceCapture --> ReconnectAuth: policy permits recovery
ReconnectAuth --> NewEpoch: auth/caps pass
NewEpoch --> RevalidateResources
RevalidateResources --> Active: proof succeeds
ReconnectAuth --> DeviceLost: fail/timeout
RevalidateResources --> DeviceLost: mismatch/ambiguity
DeviceLost --> [*]
